      "title": "Shared fishing lake",
      "instruction": "Can the town keep its lake alive?",
      "explanation": "Five fishermen share a stock. Births happen first: floor(opening stock / 100) each day; catches are simultaneous integer requests. Four each sustains only the initial 2,000 stock. No mortality, carrying capacity or fractional birth carry. Behavior policies are explicit rules, not predictions of people."
